21 0 obj
<<
/A 350 0 R
/Alt (Diagram illustrating phosphorus dynamics in soil, showing inputs from organic and inorganic sources. It highlights organic and inorganic phosphorus pools, mineralization, and uptake by plants. Issues like runoff and eutrophication risk are shown. Problems with phosphorus testing, such as mismatching chemical extractants, are noted. Features calcareous bedrock and variable pH impact.)
/K 0
/P 7 0 R
/Pg 15 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (Figure)
>>
